      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: mommy_look_an_indian_man; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts a child pointing at an Indian man, with a mother warning the child not to be influenced by him, followed by the child asking for explicit content. This juxtaposition is intended to mock and stereotype Indian men, particularly by associating them with sexualized or inappropriate behavior, which is a form of hateful content targeting a specific ethnic group. The text 'show bobs and vagene pls' is a vulgar and degrading request, reinforcing the harmful stereotype. The meme uses visual and textual elements to create a demeaning and offensive portrayal of Indian men, fitting the definition of hateful content as it directly attacks individuals based on their ethnicity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_bcb504a3"
      },
